---
title: DigestCache · one path in one process
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> Empty
  Empty --> Reading : BeginRead
  Cached --> Cached : CacheHit [stat equals key]
  Cached --> Reading : BeginRead [stat differs]
  Reading --> check : after-stat
  state check <<choice>>
  check --> Cached : FinishRead [ctime older]
  check --> Empty : FinishRead [ctime recent]
  check --> Empty : RefuseRead [stat changed]
  note right of Cached
    INV CacheNeverStale: a hit
    returns the current content's
    digest. WriteInPlace and
    Replace change the stat
    unless the write lands in the
    tick the read began, which is
    never cached.
  end note
  classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
  classDef live stroke-width:1.6px
  class Cached ok
  class Reading live
